{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "87022965-baec-8b9f-9997-948af623dcb1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T10:17:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:15:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:16:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Denise. My name is Frank Santoro. I call about a streetlight. It is on all day. Same light, the whole day, and it is already ten o'clock in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's stuck on during daylight. Where is the light, Mr. Santoro?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in front of my house. 281 Gibbs Avenue. On the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:16:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "281 Gibbs Avenue, got it. Is it just that one pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:16:26-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, only that one. The other lights, they are off now. This one, it stays on, day and night. I called before, and a representative told me a letter on the pole. I wrote it down, but now I am not sure. Was it a B or a D that the representative said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:16:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, I can't see who you spoke to from here. Is there a number on the pole itself, maybe a tag or sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there is a tag. Wait, I look. [pause] Okay. I see it is a little worn. Maybe B. But I think the representative said D. Can you say it again, please, if you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:17:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I really don't know which one they said, sorry. Don't worry about the letter. With the address, 281 Gibbs, the crew can find the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:17:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then please, I ask for a crew to check the pole. It wastes the electric, and it is a little bit annoying, you know. The light shines in the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:17:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll put in the request now for them to check it. Can I confirm your number as 401-555-0156?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:17:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:17:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
